531	/** A claim's status. It starts DRAFT; DRAFT opens to OPEN, OPEN settles to SETTLED (or, settled by a
532	 *  clerk above the clerk limit, to PENDING), PENDING is approved to SETTLED or rejected back to OPEN,
533	 *  and DRAFT, OPEN or PENDING voids to VOID. VOID is final; SETTLED is too, but for a steward voiding it
